e notes","Your current cover letter, if any","The date you need the letter ready"],"closing":"Could you confirm what the cover letter service includes, your availability and the fee?"},"careerBundle":{"name":"CV, cover letter & LinkedIn","goalLabel":"Target roles or career direction","goalPlaceholder":"For example, communications roles in development organisations","stages":["I’m starting from scratch","I have notes or an outline","I have a draft","I need a final check"],"deadlineLabel":"When would you like this ready? (optional)","support":["CV / résumé","Cover letter","LinkedIn profile"],"checklist":["Your current CV and LinkedIn profile","A target job description","Relevant work examples","Your deadline"],"closing":"Could you confirm the process, availability and the bundle fee?"},"scholarshipEssay":{"name":"Scholarship essay review","goalLabel":"Scholarship or opportunity","goalPlaceholder":"For example, the scholarship you are preparing for","stages":["I’m starting from scratch","I have notes or an outline","I have a draft","I need a final check"],"deadlineLabel":"Application deadline, if known","support":["Essay feedback and CV review","Reference-letter review","A package based on essay count"],"checklist":["The scholarship link and all essay prompts","Your essay drafts or notes","Your CV and reference-letter drafts","Your deadline"],"closing":"Could you confirm the essay band, package and availability before I pay?"},"mbaDirection":{"name":"Application direction · MBA","dropdownLabel":"Application direction · MBA","goalLabel":"Business school or MBA goal","goalPlaceholder":"For example, Oxford Saïd MBA","stages":["I’m exploring my options","I have a shortlist","I have chosen an opportunity"],"deadlineLabel":"Application deadline, if known","support":["Career goal discussion","School fit and application planning","Profile strengths and gaps"],"checklist":["Your career goals and relevant background","The schools or MBA routes you are considering","Your current application stage and deadlines","The decisions you want to work through"],"closing":"Could you let me know how you could help me plan the application, what I should share and the fee?"},"mbaEssay":{"name":"Essay development & review · MBA","dropdownLabel":"Essay development & review · MBA","goalLabel":"Business school or MBA programme","goalPlaceholder":"For example, Oxford Saïd MBA","stages":["I’m starting from scratch","I have notes or an outline","I have a draft","I need a final check"],"deadlineLabel":"Application deadline, if known","support":["Leadership and impact examples","Essay structure and specific evidence","Feedback that protects your own voice"],"checklist":["The school’s essay questions and word limits","Your draft, outline or experience notes","Relevant leadership and career examples","The deadline and the feedback you need"],"closing":"Could you share what the essay support includes, your turnaround time and the fee?"},"mbaInterview":{"name":"MBA interview preparation","dropdownLabel":"MBA interview preparation · MBA","goalLabel":"Business school or MBA programme","goalPlaceholder":"For example, Oxford Saïd MBA","stages":["I want to practise before applying","I have an interview invitation","I’ve started preparing for an interview"],"deadlineLabel":"Interview date, if known","support":["School and application context","Mock interview and feedback","Clearer examples and answers"],"checklist":["The business school and programme","Your submitted application and interview format, if known","The interview date, if confirmed","The examples or questions you want to practise"],"closing":"Could you share how the sessions work, your availability and the fee?"},"mbaPackage":{"name":"MBA application package","goalLabel":"Business schools you’re considering","goalPlaceholder":"For example, Oxford Saïd and London Business School","stages":["I’m exploring my options","I have a shortlist","I have chosen an opportunity"],"deadlineLabel":"Application deadline, if known","support":["Brainstorming and essay feedback","CV and recommender-letter support","Scholarship guidance at the selected level"],"checklist":["Your school list and deadlines","Your CV and essay drafts or notes","Relevant recommender information","Your career goals and funding needs"],"closing":"Could you confirm the package, timeline and next steps before payment?"}}}'::jsonb)
on conflict (key) do nothing;
